<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Our Story' }) %>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/header') %>

  <main id="main">
    <section class="page-head">
      <div class="wrap-wide">
        <nav class="crumbs reveal" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
          <a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span>About</span>
        </nav>
        <span class="eyebrow reveal">Since <%= catalog.brand.since %></span>
        <h1 class="h1 reveal" data-delay="1">We make fewer things,<br>and we make them <em class="serif-italic">properly</em>.</h1>
        <p class="lede reveal" data-delay="2">
          <%= catalog.brand.name %> began in a <%= catalog.brand.city %> workshop with one stubborn idea:
          that most of what we own could last considerably longer than it does.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="craft">
      <div class="wrap-wide">
        <div class="editorial">
          <div class="editorial__media reveal"><%- catalog.sceneArt('clay', 0, 'portrait') %></div>
          <div class="editorial__body reveal" data-delay="1">
            <span class="eyebrow">Craftsmanship</span>
            <h2 class="h2" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem">The slowest part is the point</h2>
            <p class="lede">
              A dining table takes eleven weeks to leave our workshop. Most of that is waiting:
              for timber to settle, for oil to cure, for a joint to be tested and, often, remade.
            </p>
            <p class="muted">
              We could compress it. Every supplier we have ever spoken to has offered to. But the
              parts of the process you cannot see are precisely the parts that decide whether a
              piece is still standing in twenty years.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--cream" id="materials">
      <div class="wrap-wide">
        <div class="editorial editorial--reverse">
          <div class="editorial__media reveal"><%- catalog.sceneArt('sage', 1, 'portrait') %></div>
          <div class="editorial__body reveal" data-delay="1">
            <span class="eyebrow">Materials</span>
            <h2 class="h2" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem">Honest, and only honest</h2>
            <p class="lede">
              Solid timber rather than veneer. Vegetable-tanned leather rather than coated.
              Undyed cloth wherever colour is not the point.
            </p>
            <p class="muted">
              These choices cost more and they photograph less dramatically. They also age
              instead of degrading, so a scratch becomes patina rather than damage.
            </p>
            <div class="pillars">
              <div class="pillar">
                <span class="pillar__n">92%</span>
                <h4>Natural fibres</h4>
                <p>Across the current range, by weight.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="pillar">
                <span class="pillar__n">14</span>
                <h4>Workshops</h4>
                <p>All visited, all named on request.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="pillar">
                <span class="pillar__n">0</span>
                <h4>Single-use plastic</h4>
                <p>In packaging, since 2019.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="wrap-wide">
        <article class="feature reveal">
          <div class="feature__media"><%- catalog.sceneArt('stone', 1, 'wide') %></div>
          <div class="feature__body">
            <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">The Journal</span>
            <h2 class="h2">Notes from the workshop</h2>
            <p>
              Every few weeks we write up what we are working on: a joint that failed, a mill that
              closed, a material we abandoned after eight months of testing. It is less polished
              than a catalogue and considerably more useful.
            </p>
            <a class="btn btn--light" href="/shop">Browse the collection</a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--beige" id="care">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-head reveal">
          <div class="section-head__text">
            <span class="eyebrow">Practical</span>
            <h2 class="h2">Shipping, returns &amp; care</h2>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="accordion reveal">
          <div class="accordion__item">
            <button class="accordion__btn" type="button" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="ab-ship">
              Shipping <span class="accordion__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </button>
            <div class="accordion__panel is-open" id="ab-ship">
              <div>
                <p>
                  Orders are dispatched within two working days. Standard delivery takes 3 to 5 days and is
                  complimentary on orders over $150. Furniture is delivered by appointment, unpacked in
                  the room of your choosing, and the packaging taken away.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="accordion__item">
            <button class="accordion__btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="ab-returns">
              Returns <span class="accordion__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </button>
            <div class="accordion__panel" id="ab-returns">
              <div>
                <p>
                  Thirty days, unused, in the original packaging. Full refund, return postage covered.
                  If something arrives damaged, tell us and we will replace it before arranging the return.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="accordion__item">
            <button class="accordion__btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="ab-care">
              Product care <span class="accordion__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </button>
            <div class="accordion__panel" id="ab-care">
              <div>
                <p>
                  Care instructions ship with every piece and are listed on each product page. In short:
                  oil timber once a year, condition leather at the end of each season, wash cloth cold and
                  dry it flat. Anything that wears out can be repaired. Write to us with the reference number.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="accordion__item">
            <button class="accordion__btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="ab-guarantee">
              Guarantee <span class="accordion__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </button>
            <div class="accordion__panel" id="ab-guarantee">
              <div>
                <p>
                  Two years against manufacturing fault, and an open offer to repair anything we made
                  for as long as we can source the parts. That has held since <%= catalog.brand.since %>.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
